# Keep text files LF on every platform, including Windows checkouts.
#
# The /doc-confluence skill parses values (Framework path, Output path, repo
# paths) out of markdown tables using shell tools. A CRLF checkout would leave a
# carriage return glued to the parsed value and produce paths that do not exist.
# The skill strips \r defensively, but normalizing here removes the problem at
# the source.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
